  "question": {
    "text": "Three particles, each of mass ' $m$ ' grams situated at the vertices of an equilateral $\\triangle A B C$ of side ' $a$ ' $\\mathrm{cm}$ (as shown in the figure). The moment of inertia of the system about a line $\\mathrm{AX}$ perpendicular to $\\mathrm{AB}$ and in the plane of $\\mathrm{ABC}$ in $\\mathrm{g}-\\mathrm{cm}^2$ units will be\n <img src=\"assets\\qt0005_19a7ea695734.png\">"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$2 \\mathrm{ma}^2$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{3}{2} \\mathrm{ma}^2$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{3}{4} \\mathrm{ma}^2$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\frac{5}{4} \\mathrm{ma}^2$",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0005_9bc6c2a524b0.png\"><br>\n$\\mathrm{I}=\\mathrm{~ma}^2+\\mathrm{m}\\left(\\mathrm{a} \\cos 60^{\\circ}\\right)^2=m \\mathrm{a}^2+\\frac{\\mathrm{ma}^2}{4}=\\frac{5 \\mathrm{ma}^2}{4}$"
  }
}